{"unit_id":"sailoumili__novel-writer#feature-chapter-review","repo":"sailoumili/novel-writer","commit":"bd0082106998a4737d3428bed334cacde46accd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["agent.cordis.yml:41-43"],"text":"「逐章写作与复核」：每章由文笔代理根据宪法、世界设定、人物档案和伏笔台账写作，再交复核代理检查；红灯意见会带回重写，审阅还会提供节奏建议与章末钩子备选。"}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__novel-writer#feature-file-versioning","repo":"sailoumili/novel-writer","commit":"bd0082106998a4737d3428bed334cacde46accd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["agent.cordis.yml:62-71"],"text":"「项目文件与章节版本」：提示词规定在工作区按项目保存设定、人物、伏笔台账、章节目录和正文；改稿另存新版本，续写时读取各章最高版本号。"}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__novel-writer#caveat-local-preset","repo":"sailoumili/novel-writer","commit":"bd0082106998a4737d3428bed334cacde46accd9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-45"],"text":"novel-writer 使用 DSH_HOME 指定 DSH 主目录，未设置时默认写入 ~/.dsh/.agent-presets/novel-writer；插件复制预设文件时仅在目标文件不存在时执行，已有文件会跳过。"}
{"unit_id":"sailoumili__novel-writer#caveat-manual-download","repo":"sailoumili/novel-writer","commit":"bd0082106998a4737d3428bed334cacde46accd9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["install.sh:9-18","install.ps1:10-24"],"text":"提供的 Bash 和 PowerShell 手动安装脚本会从 raw.githubusercontent.com 下载 agent.cordis.yml 与 preset.yml 到用户目录；插件入口的复制行为则会跳过已存在的目标文件。"}
